OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the robot looking after Vera,
OL,4,A74, in her own home
OL,5,
OL,6,FVera Gadsdon, 74, is one of the
OL,7,Fresidents at a retirement housing
OL,8,Fcomplex in Lewisham.
OL,10,FShe has a carer, Pinar Elmaz, and a
OL,11,Fhelper called Robert.
OL,13,FRobert reminds her when to take her
OL,14,Fmedication, to do her washing and even
OL,15,Fgives her knitting tips.
OL,17,FRobert is a robot, just one of those
OL,18,Fthat is now providing company and
OL,19,Fmedical assistance in care homes. Some
OL,20,Fsay the droids are cutting costs and
OL,21,Ffreeing up staff.
